---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import profile from '../data/profile.json';
const base = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')}/`;
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><BaseHead title="About Me | Matthew Ho" description="About Matthew Ho and his portfolio." /></head><body><Header /><main><article><div class="prose"><div class="title"><h1>Hi, I’m Matthew.</h1><p>Welcome to my corner of the internet.</p><hr /></div>
<div class="portrait">{profile.photo ? <a href="https://github.com/goatfreeman" aria-label="Visit Matthew Ho’s GitHub profile"><img src={profile.photo.startsWith('https://') ? profile.photo : `${base}${profile.photo.replace(/^\//, '')}`} alt={profile.photoAlt} /></a> : <p>Photo coming soon</p>}</div>
<h2>Nice to meet you.</h2><p>I’m Matthew Ho, and this portfolio brings together my data projects from ITCS 3162 at UNC Charlotte.</p><p>Here you’ll find explorations of data, models, and the limits of their conclusions.</p><p><a href={`${base}projects/`}>See my projects →</a></p>
<section><h2>Certifications</h2>{profile.certifications.length ? <ul>{profile.certifications.map(cert => <li>{cert}</li>)}</ul> : <p>No certifications listed yet.</p>}</section></div></article></main><Footer /></body></html>
<style>.title { margin-bottom: 1em; padding: 1em 0; text-align: center; line-height: 1; }.title h1 { margin: 0 0 .5em; }.portrait { text-align: center; color: rgb(var(--gray)); }.portrait img { display: block; margin: auto; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: var(--box-shadow); }</style>
